# Quality and Review

Use the narrowest check capable of disproving a change. Replace the discovery
notes below when canonical commands are added to the repository.

{{CHECK_ROUTER}}

## Review routing

- Self-review every diff for scope, correctness, regression risk, and accidental
  edits.
- Add one independent review for runtime, data, security, authentication,
  migration, or release risk.
- Record evidence and unresolved risk in the pull request or handoff.

## Evidence boundaries

Local, browser, Preview, Production, and provider evidence are separate.
Generated reports and screenshots do not prove a live environment.

## Release and provider gates

Human approval is required before merge and before any Production or external
provider mutation.
